The model files were produced by open_pdks (https://github.com/RTimothyEdwards/
open_pdks) from the SkyWater foundry sources, and obtained as a prebuilt sky130A
PDK via the ciel package manager (https://github.com/fossi-foundation/ciel).

  open_pdks build: b344c97eacc2aaf8e14ae7e43e2e9dc0871de2c0
  Extracted from:  sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice  and  sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_pr/spice

Model content is unmodified from that build. See README.md for details.
